#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:2
msgid "Git integration (GitHub, GitLab, Bitbucket)"
msgstr "Git 集成（GitHub、GitLab、Bitbucket）"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:4
msgid ""
"Your Read the Docs account can be connected to your Git provider's account. "
"Connecting your account provides the following features:"
msgstr "你的 Read the Docs 账户可与 Git 服务商账户关联。关联账户提供以下功能："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:7
msgid "🔑️ Easy login"
msgstr "🔑️ 轻松登录"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:8
msgid "Log in to Read the Docs with your |git_providers_or| account."
msgstr "用你的 |git_providers_or| 账户登录 Read the Docs。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:10
msgid "🔁️ List your projects"
msgstr "🔁️ 列出你的项目"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:11
msgid ""
"Select a project to automatically import from all your Git repositories and "
"organizations. See: :doc:`/intro/add-project`."
msgstr "从所有 Git 仓库和组织中选择项目自动导入。见：:doc:`/intro/add-project` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:14
msgid "⚙️ Automatic configuration"
msgstr "⚙️ 自动配置"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:15
msgid ""
"Have your Git repository automatically configured with your Read the Docs "
":term:`webhook`, which allows Read the Docs to build your docs on every "
"change to your repository."
msgstr "你的 Git 仓库将自动配置 Read the Docs :term:`webhook` ，使 Read the Docs 能在仓库每次变更时构建文档。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:18
msgid "🚥️ Commit status"
msgstr "🚥️ 提交状态"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:19
msgid ""
"See your documentation build status as a commit status indicator on "
":doc:`pull request builds </pull-requests>`."
msgstr "在 :doc:`Pull Request 构建 </pull-requests>` 上以提交状态指示器查看文档构建状态。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:23
msgid ":ref:`intro/add-project:Manually add your project`"
msgstr ":ref:`intro/add-project:Manually add your project`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:24
msgid ""
"Using a different provider? You can configure it manually. Read the Docs "
"still supports other providers such as Gitea or GitHub Enterprise."
msgstr "使用不同的服务商？可手动配置。Read the Docs 仍支持 Gitea 或 GitHub Enterprise 等其他服务商。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:28
msgid "Getting started"
msgstr "快速开始"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:30
msgid "✅️ Signed up with your Git provider?"
msgstr "✅️ 已用 Git 服务商注册？"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:31
msgid ""
"If you signed up or logged in to Read the Docs with your |git_providers_or| "
"credentials, you're all done. Your account is connected."
msgstr "如果你已用 |git_providers_or| 凭据注册或登录 Read the Docs，一切就绪。你的账户已关联。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:34
msgid "The rest of this guide explains how the automatic configuration works."
msgstr "本指南其余部分解释自动配置的工作原理。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:36
msgid "⏩️️ Signed up with your email address?"
msgstr "⏩️️ 用邮箱注册？"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:37
msgid ""
"If you have signed up to Read the Docs with your email address, you can add "
"the connection to the Git provider afterward. You can also add a connection "
"to an additional Git provider this way."
msgstr "如果你用邮箱注册了 Read the Docs，之后可添加 Git 服务商连接。也可用此法添加额外的 Git 服务商连接。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:41
msgid "Please follow :doc:`/guides/connecting-git-account` in this case."
msgstr "这种情况下请参考 :doc:`/guides/connecting-git-account` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:43
msgid ""
"Once you have your account connected, you can follow the :doc:`/intro/add-"
"project` guide to actually add your project to Read the Docs."
msgstr "账户关联后，可按 :doc:`/intro/add-project` 指南将项目添加到 Read the Docs。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:47
msgid "How automatic configuration works"
msgstr "自动配置如何工作"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:49
msgid ""
"When your Read the Docs account is connected to |git_providers_or| and you "
":doc:`add a new Read the Docs project </intro/add-project>`:"
msgstr ""
"当你的 Read the Docs 账户已连接 |git_providers_or| 且你 :doc:`添加新 Read the Docs 项目 "
"</intro/add-project>` 时："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:51
msgid ""
"Read the Docs automatically creates a Read the Docs Integration that matches"
" your Git provider."
msgstr "Read the Docs 会自动创建一个与你的 Git 服务商匹配的 Read the Docs 集成。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:52
msgid ""
"Read the Docs creates an incoming webhook with your Git provider, which is "
"automatically added to your Git repository's settings using the account "
"connection."
msgstr "Read the Docs 会与你的 Git 服务商创建一个传入 Webhook，利用账户连接自动添加到你的 Git 仓库设置中。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:54
msgid ""
"After project creation, you can continue to configure the project. All "
"settings can be modified, including the ones that were automatically "
"created."
msgstr "项目创建后，你可继续配置项目。所有设置均可修改，包括自动创建的设置。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:61
msgid ""
"A single Read the Docs account can connect to many different Git providers. "
"This allows you to have a single login for all your various identities."
msgstr "一个 Read the Docs 账户可连接多个不同的 Git 服务商。这样你就能用一个登录管理所有身份。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:65
msgid "Read the Docs incoming webhook"
msgstr "Read the Docs 传入 Webhook"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:69
msgid ""
"When using our :ref:`reference/git-integration:GitHub App`, Read the Docs "
"subscribes to all required events. You don't need to create a webhook on "
"your repository."
msgstr ""
"使用我们的 :ref:`reference/git-integration:GitHub App` 时，Read the Docs "
"会订阅所有必需事件。你无需在仓库上创建 Webhook。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:72
msgid ""
"Accounts with |git_providers_and| integration automatically have Read the "
"Docs' incoming :term:`webhook` configured on all Git repositories that are "
"imported. Other setups can set up the webhook through :doc:`manual "
"configuration </guides/setup/git-repo-manual>`."
msgstr ""
"具有 |git_providers_and| 集成的账户，导入的所有 Git 仓库会自动配置 Read the Docs 的传入 "
":term:`webhook` 。其他设置可通过 :doc:`手动配置 </guides/setup/git-repo-manual>` 设置 "
"Webhook。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:75
msgid ""
"When an incoming webhook notification is received, Read the Docs ensures "
"that it matches an existing project. Once the webhook is validated, an "
"action is taken based on the information inside of the webhook."
msgstr "收到传入 Webhook 通知时，Read the Docs 会确保其匹配现有项目。验证通过后，根据 Webhook 内容采取相应动作。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:80
msgid "Possible webhook action outcomes are:"
msgstr "可能的 Webhook 动作结果："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:82
msgid ":doc:`Builds </builds>` the latest commit."
msgstr ":doc:`构建 </builds>` 最新提交。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:83
msgid "Synchronizes your versions based on the latest tag and branch data in Git."
msgstr "根据 Git 中最新的标签和分支数据同步版本。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:84
msgid "Creates a :doc:`pull request build </pull-requests>`."
msgstr "创建 :doc:`Pull Request 构建 </pull-requests>` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:85
msgid "Runs your :doc:`automation rules</automation-rules>`."
msgstr "运行你的 :doc:`自动化规则 </automation-rules>` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:87
msgid "Screenshot of the Dashboard view for the incoming webhook"
msgstr "传入 Webhook 的仪表盘视图截图"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:90
msgid ""
"All calls to the incoming webhook are logged. Each call can trigger builds "
"and version synchronization."
msgstr "所有传入 Webhook 调用均被记录。每次调用均可触发构建和版本同步。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:93
msgid ""
"On |com_brand|, Git integration makes it possible for us to synchronize your"
" Git repository's access rights from your Git provider. That way, the same "
"access rights are effective on Read the Docs and you don't have to configure"
" access in two places. See more in our :ref:`sso_git_provider`."
msgstr ""
"在 |com_brand| 上，Git 集成让我们能从 Git 服务商同步仓库访问权限。这样相同的访问权限在 Read the Docs "
"上生效，无需在两处配置。详见 :ref:`sso_git_provider` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:99
msgid "How does the connection work?"
msgstr "连接如何工作？"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:101
msgid ""
"Read the Docs uses `OAuth`_ to connect to your account at "
"|git_providers_or|. You are asked to grant permissions for Read the Docs to "
"perform a number of actions on your behalf."
msgstr ""
"Read the Docs 用 `OAuth`_ 连接你在 |git_providers_or| 的账户。系统会请求你授权 Read the Docs "
"代表你执行若干操作。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:104
msgid ""
"At the same time, we use this process for authentication (login) since we "
"trust that |git_providers_or| have verified your user account and email "
"address."
msgstr "同时，我们用此流程做认证（登录），因为我们信任 |git_providers_or| 已验证你的用户账户和邮箱。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:107
msgid ""
"By granting Read the Docs the requested permissions, we are issued a secret "
"OAuth token from your Git provider. Using the secret token, we can "
"automatically configure repositories during :doc:`project creation </intro"
"/add-project>`. We also use the token to send back build statuses and "
"preview URLs for :doc:`pull requests </pull-requests>`."
msgstr ""
"授予 Read the Docs 请求的权限后，我们会从 Git 服务商获得一个秘密 OAuth 令牌。用该令牌可在 :doc:`项目创建 "
"</intro/add-project>` 时自动配置仓库。我们也用该令牌回传构建状态和 :doc:`Pull Request </pull-"
"requests>` 的预览 URL。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:117
msgid ""
"Access granted to Read the Docs can always be revoked. This is a function "
"offered by all Git providers."
msgstr "授予 Read the Docs 的访问权限随时可撤销。所有 Git 服务商均提供此功能。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:121
msgid "Git provider integrations"
msgstr "Git 服务商集成"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:123
msgid ""
"If your project is using :doc:`Organizations </commercial/organizations>` "
"(|com_brand|) or :term:`maintainers <maintainer>` (|org_brand|), then you "
"need to be aware of *who* is setting up the integration for the project."
msgstr ""
"如果项目使用 :doc:`Organizations </commercial/organizations>` (|com_brand|) 或 "
":term:`maintainers <maintainer>` (|org_brand|)，需注意是谁为项目设置集成。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:126
msgid ""
"The Read the Docs user who sets up the project through the automatic import "
"should also have admin rights to the Git repository."
msgstr "通过自动导入设置项目的 Read the Docs 用户，也应拥有 Git 仓库的管理员权限。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:128
msgid ""
"A Git provider integration is active through the authentication of the user "
"that creates the integration. If this user is removed, make sure to verify "
"and potentially recreate all Git integrations for the project."
msgstr "Git 服务商集成由创建集成的用户认证激活。若该用户被移除，请验证并视情况重建项目的所有 Git 集成。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:134
msgid ""
"When using our :ref:`reference/git-integration:GitHub App`, if the original "
"user who connected the repository to Read the Docs loses access to the "
"project or repository, the GitHub App will still have access to the "
"repository, and the integrations will continue to work."
msgstr ""
"使用我们的 :ref:`reference/git-integration:GitHub App` 时，若连接仓库到 Read the Docs "
"的原用户失去项目或仓库访问权，GitHub App 仍有仓库访问权，集成将继续工作。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:139
msgid "Permissions for connected accounts"
msgstr "已连接账户的权限"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:141
msgid ""
"Read the Docs does not generally ask for *write* permission to your "
"repository code (with one exception detailed below). However, we do need "
"permissions for authorizing your account so that you can log in to Read the "
"Docs with your connected account credentials."
msgstr ""
"Read the Docs 通常不请求仓库代码的*写入* 权限（下文详述的一个例外除外）。但我们需要授权你账户的权限，以便你用关联账户凭据登录 Read"
" the Docs。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:148
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:280
msgid "GitHub App"
msgstr "GitHub App"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:150
msgid ""
"Read the Docs requests the following permissions when connecting your Read "
"the Docs account to our :ref:`GitHub App <reference/git-integration:GitHub "
"App>`."
msgstr ""
"连接 Read the Docs 账户到我们的 :ref:`GitHub App <reference/git-integration:GitHub "
"App>` 时，Read the Docs 会请求以下权限。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:152
msgid "Account email addresses (read only)"
msgstr "账户邮箱（只读）"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:153
msgid ""
"We ask for this so we can verify your email address and create a Read the "
"Docs account."
msgstr "请求此权限以便验证你的邮箱并创建 Read the Docs 账户。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:155
msgid ""
"When installing the Read the Docs GitHub App in a repository, you will be "
"asked to grant the following permissions:"
msgstr "在仓库安装 Read the Docs GitHub App 时，会请求授予以下权限："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:157
msgid "Repository permissions"
msgstr "仓库权限"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:158
msgid "Commit statuses (read and write)"
msgstr "提交状态（读写）"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:159
msgid "This allows Read the Docs to report the status of the build to GitHub."
msgstr "这允许 Read the Docs 向 GitHub 报告构建状态。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:160
msgid "Contents (read only)"
msgstr "内容（只读）"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:161
msgid ""
"This allows Read the Docs to clone the repository and build the "
"documentation."
msgstr "这允许 Read the Docs 克隆仓库并构建文档。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:162
msgid "Metadata (read only)"
msgstr "元数据（只读）"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:163
msgid ""
"This allows Read the Docs to read the repository collaborators and the "
"permissions they have on the repository. This is used to determine if the "
"user can connect a repository to a Read the Docs project."
msgstr "这允许 Read the Docs 读取仓库协作者及其权限。用于判断用户能否将仓库连接到 Read the Docs 项目。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:165
msgid "Pull requests (read and write)"
msgstr "Pull Request（读写）"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:166
msgid ""
"This allows Read the Docs to subscribe to pull request events, and to create"
" a comment on the pull request with information about the build."
msgstr "这允许 Read the Docs 订阅 Pull Request 事件，并在 Pull Request 上创建包含构建信息的评论。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:168
msgid "Checks (read and write)"
msgstr "检查（读写）"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:169
msgid ""
"This allows Read the Docs to use the GitHub Checks API to report the status "
"of the build. This isn't used yet, but we may use it in the future."
msgstr "这允许 Read the Docs 用 GitHub Checks API 报告构建状态。暂未使用，但未来可能用到。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:172
msgid "Organization permissions"
msgstr "组织权限"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:173
msgid "Members (read only)"
msgstr "成员（只读）"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:174
msgid "This allows Read the Docs to read the organization members."
msgstr "这允许 Read the Docs 读取组织成员。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:176
msgid "GitHub"
msgstr "GitHub"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:178
msgid ""
"Read the Docs requests the following permissions (more precisely, `OAuth "
"scopes`_) when connecting your Read the Docs account to GitHub."
msgstr "连接 Read the Docs 账户到 GitHub 时，Read the Docs 请求以下权限（更准确说是 `OAuth scopes`_ ）："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:183
msgid "Read access to your email address (``user:email``)"
msgstr "读取你的邮箱地址 (``user:email``)"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:184
msgid ""
"We ask for this so you can create a Read the Docs account and log in with "
"your GitHub credentials."
msgstr "请求此权限以便你用 GitHub 凭据创建 Read the Docs 账户并登录。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:186
msgid "Administering webhooks (``admin:repo_hook``)"
msgstr "管理 Webhook (``admin:repo_hook``)"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:187
msgid ""
"We ask for this so we can create :term:`webhooks <webhook>` on your "
"repositories when you import them into Read the Docs. This allows us to "
"build the docs when you push new commits."
msgstr "请求此权限以便将仓库导入 Read the Docs 时创建 :term:`webhooks <webhook>` 。这让我们能在你推送新提交时构建文档。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:190
msgid "Read access to your organizations (``read:org``)"
msgstr "读取你的组织 (``read:org``)"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:191
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:220
msgid ""
"We ask for this so we know which organizations you have access to. This "
"allows you to filter repositories by organization when importing "
"repositories."
msgstr "请求此权限以便知道你有权访问哪些组织。这允许导入仓库时按组织筛选。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:194
msgid "Repository status (``repo:status``)"
msgstr "仓库状态 (``repo:status``)"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:195
msgid ""
"Repository statuses allow Read the Docs to report the status (e.g. passed, "
"failed, pending) of pull requests to GitHub."
msgstr "仓库状态允许 Read the Docs 向 GitHub 报告 Pull Request 的状态（如通过、失败、待定）。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:200
msgid ""
":doc:`Read the Docs Business </commercial/index>` asks for one additional "
"permission (``repo``) to allow access to private repositories and to allow "
"us to set up SSH keys to clone your private repositories. Unfortunately, "
"this is the permission for read/write control of the repository but there "
"isn't a more granular permission that only allows setting up SSH keys for "
"read access."
msgstr ""
":doc:`Read the Docs Business </commercial/index>` 请求一个额外权限 (``repo``) "
"以访问私有仓库并允许我们设置 SSH 密钥克隆私有仓库。遗憾的是这是仓库读写控制权限，没有更细粒度的权限仅允许为读取访问设置 SSH 密钥。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:207
msgid "Bitbucket"
msgstr "Bitbucket"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:209
msgid "We request permissions for:"
msgstr "我们请求以下权限："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:211
msgid "Administering your repositories (``repository:admin``)"
msgstr "管理你的仓库 (``repository:admin``)"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:212
msgid ""
"We ask for this so we can create :term:`webhooks <webhook>` on your "
"repositories when you import them into Read the Docs. This allows us to "
"build the docs when you push new commits. NB! This permission scope does "
"**not** include any write access to code."
msgstr ""
"请求此权限以便将仓库导入 Read the Docs 时创建 :term:`webhooks <webhook>` "
"。这让我们能在你推送新提交时构建文档。注意！此权限范围**不** 包含任何代码写入权限。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:216
msgid "Reading your account information including your email address"
msgstr "读取你的账户信息（含邮箱）"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:217
msgid ""
"We ask for this so you can create a Read the Docs account and log in with "
"your Bitbucket credentials."
msgstr "请求此权限以便你用 Bitbucket 凭据创建 Read the Docs 账户并登录。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:219
msgid "Read access to your team memberships"
msgstr "读取你的团队成员资格"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:223
msgid "Read access to your repositories"
msgstr "读取你的仓库"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:224
msgid "We ask for this so we know which repositories you have access to."
msgstr "请求此权限以便知道你有权访问哪些仓库。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:226
msgid ""
"To read more about Bitbucket permissions, see `official Bitbucket "
"documentation on API scopes`_"
msgstr "详见 `official Bitbucket documentation on API scopes`_"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:231
msgid "GitLab"
msgstr "GitLab"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:233
msgid "Like the others, we request permissions for:"
msgstr "与其他服务商一样，我们请求以下权限："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:235
msgid "Reading your account information (``read_user``)"
msgstr "读取你的账户信息 (``read_user``)"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:236
msgid "API access (``api``) which is needed to create webhooks in GitLab"
msgstr "API 访问 (``api``)，在 GitLab 中创建 Webhook 所需"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:242
msgid "GitHub permission troubleshooting"
msgstr "GitHub 权限故障排查"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:244
msgid "**Repositories not in your list to import**."
msgstr "**仓库不在导入列表中** 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:246
msgid ""
"Many organizations require approval for each OAuth application that is used,"
" or you might have disabled it in the past for your personal account. This "
"can happen at the personal or organization level, depending on where the "
"project you are trying to access has permissions from."
msgstr "许多组织要求批准每个使用的 OAuth 应用，或你过去可能在个人账户禁用了它。这可能发生在个人或组织层面，取决于你试图访问的项目的权限来源。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:253
msgid ""
"If you are using the :ref:`GitHub App <reference/git-integration:GitHub "
"App>`, you only need to make sure that the GitHub App is installed in your "
"account or organization, and that it has access to the repository you want "
"to use for your project. See :ref:`GitHub App troubleshooting <reference"
"/git-integration:Troubleshooting>` for more information."
msgstr ""
"如果你使用 :ref:`GitHub App <reference/git-integration:GitHub App>` ，只需确保 GitHub "
"App 已安装在你的账户或组织中，且有权访问你想用于项目的仓库。详见 :ref:`GitHub App 故障排查 <reference/git-"
"integration:Troubleshooting>` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:260
msgid "Personal Account"
msgstr "个人账户"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:262
msgid ""
"You need to make sure that you have granted access to the Read the Docs "
"`OAuth App`_ to your **personal GitHub account**. If you do not see Read the"
" Docs in the `OAuth App`_ settings, you might need to disconnect and "
"reconnect the GitHub service."
msgstr ""
"你需要确保已向你的**个人 GitHub 账户** 授予 Read the Docs `OAuth App`_ 访问权。若在 `OAuth App`_ "
"设置中未见 Read the Docs，可能需要断开并重新连接 GitHub 服务。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:265
msgid ""
"GitHub docs on `requesting access to your personal OAuth`_ for step-by-step "
"instructions."
msgstr "GitHub 文档中的 `requesting access to your personal OAuth`_ 有分步说明。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:270
msgid "Organization Account"
msgstr "组织账户"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:272
msgid ""
"You need to make sure that you have granted access to the Read the Docs "
"OAuth App to your **organization GitHub account**. If you don't see \"Read "
"the Docs\" listed, then you might need to connect GitHub to your social "
"accounts as noted above."
msgstr ""
"你需要确保已向你的**组织 GitHub 账户** 授予 Read the Docs OAuth App 访问权。如果列表中没有 \"Read the "
"Docs\"，可能需要按上文所述将 GitHub 连接到社交账户。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:275
msgid ""
"GitHub doc on `requesting access to your organization OAuth`_ for step-by-"
"step instructions."
msgstr "GitHub 文档中的 `requesting access to your organization OAuth`_ 有分步说明。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:282
msgid ""
"We now provide a `GitHub App <https://docs.github.com/en/apps/overview>`__ "
"for connecting your GitHub account to Read the Docs. This will replace the "
"old OAuth GitHub integration. Read the Docs provides two GitHub Apps, one "
"for each of our platforms:"
msgstr ""
"我们现在提供 `GitHub App <https://docs.github.com/en/apps/overview>`__ 以连接 GitHub "
"账户到 Read the Docs。这将取代旧的 OAuth GitHub 集成。Read the Docs 为两个平台各提供一个 GitHub "
"App："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:286
msgid "`Read the Docs Community <https://github.com/apps/read-the-docs-community>`__"
msgstr "`Read the Docs Community <https://github.com/apps/read-the-docs-community>`__"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:287
msgid "`Read the Docs Business <https://github.com/apps/read-the-docs-business>`__"
msgstr "`Read the Docs Business <https://github.com/apps/read-the-docs-business>`__"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:290
msgid "Connecting your account and installing the app"
msgstr "连接账户并安装 App"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:292
msgid "Using the GitHub App takes two separate steps:"
msgstr "使用 GitHub App 需两个独立步骤："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:294
msgid "Connect your GitHub account"
msgstr "连接 GitHub 账户"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:295
msgid ""
"Happens when you sign up or log in to Read the Docs with GitHub. This "
"identifies you on Read the Docs, but doesn't give Read the Docs access to "
"any repository."
msgstr ""
"在用 GitHub 注册或登录 Read the Docs 时发生。这在 Read the Docs 上识别你，但不给 Read the Docs "
"任何仓库访问权。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:297
msgid "Install the GitHub App"
msgstr "安装 GitHub App"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:298
msgid ""
"Happens on GitHub, on your personal account or on an organization. This is "
"what gives Read the Docs access to the repositories you select."
msgstr "在 GitHub 上进行，针对个人账户或组织。这赋予 Read the Docs 你所选仓库的访问权。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:301
msgid ""
"If you connected your account but your repositories don't show up when "
"adding a project, the app is probably not installed yet, or it doesn't have "
"access to those repositories."
msgstr "如果你已连接账户但添加项目时仓库不显示，App 可能未安装，或无权访问那些仓库。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:305
msgid "Features"
msgstr "功能"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:307
msgid ""
"When using GitHub, Read the Docs uses a GitHub App to interact with your "
"repositories. This has the following benefits over using an OAuth "
"application:"
msgstr "使用 GitHub 时，Read the Docs 用 GitHub App 与你的仓库交互。这比使用 OAuth 应用有以下优势："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:310
msgid ""
"More control over which repositories Read the Docs can access. You don't "
"need to grant access to all your repositories in order to create an account "
"or connect a project to a single repository."
msgstr "对 Read the Docs 可访问的仓库有更多控制。创建账户或将项目连接到单个仓库时，无需授权所有仓库。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:312
msgid ""
"No need to create webhooks on your repositories. The GitHub App subscribes "
"to all required events when you install it."
msgstr "无需在仓库创建 Webhook。安装 GitHub App 时它会订阅所有必需事件。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:314
msgid ""
"No need to create a deploy key on your repository (|com_brand| only). The "
"GitHub App can clone your private repositories using a temporary token."
msgstr "无需在仓库创建部署密钥（仅 |com_brand|）。GitHub App 可用临时令牌克隆你的私有仓库。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:316
msgid ""
"If the original user who connected the repository to Read the Docs loses "
"access to the project or repository, the GitHub App will still have access "
"to the repository."
msgstr "若连接仓库到 Read the Docs 的原用户失去项目或仓库访问权，GitHub App 仍有仓库访问权。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:318
msgid ""
"You can revoke access to the GitHub App at any time from your GitHub "
"settings."
msgstr "你可随时在 GitHub 设置中撤销 GitHub App 访问权。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:319
msgid ""
"Never out of sync with changes on your repository. The GitHub App subscribes"
" to all required events and will always keep your project up to date with "
"your repository."
msgstr "与仓库变更永不同步。GitHub App 订阅所有必需事件，始终保持项目与仓库同步。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:322
msgid ""
"The following features are only available for projects connected through the"
" GitHub App:"
msgstr "以下功能仅对通过 GitHub App 连接的项目可用："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:324
msgid ""
":ref:`Build overview comment on pull requests <visual-diff:Show build "
"overview in pull requests>`, with a link to the preview and the list of "
"files changed."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Pull Request 上的构建概览评论 <visual-diff:Show build overview in pull "
"requests>` ，含预览链接和变更文件列表。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:326
msgid ""
":ref:`Webhook filters <automation-rules:Webhook filters>` in automation "
"rules, for example to :doc:`skip builds </guides/build/skip-or-cancel-"
"builds>` when no documentation files changed."
msgstr ""
"自动化规则中的 :ref:`Webhook 过滤器 <automation-rules:Webhook filters>` ，例如 "
":doc:`无文档文件变更时跳过构建 </guides/build/skip-or-cancel-builds>` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:330
msgid "Adding a project from a repository"
msgstr "从仓库添加项目"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:332
msgid ""
"To add a project from a repository, you need to install the Read the Docs "
"GitHub App and grant access to that repository. Use the links below to "
"complete the installation and permissions, then create the project from your"
" **Read the Docs account**."
msgstr ""
"从仓库添加项目，需安装 Read the Docs GitHub App 并授权该仓库。用下方链接完成安装和授权，然后从你的 **Read the "
"Docs 账户** 创建项目。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:337
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:352
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:396
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:443
msgid ""
"`Read the Docs Community <https://github.com/apps/read-the-docs-"
"community/installations/new/>`__"
msgstr ""
"`Read the Docs Community <https://github.com/apps/read-the-docs-"
"community/installations/new/>`__"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:338
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:353
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:397
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:444
msgid ""
"`Read the Docs Business <https://github.com/apps/read-the-docs-"
"business/installations/new/>`__"
msgstr ""
"`Read the Docs Business <https://github.com/apps/read-the-docs-"
"business/installations/new/>`__"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:340
msgid ""
"Once you have installed the GitHub App, in Read the Docs, click on the "
":guilabel:`Projects` tab, and click on :guilabel:`Add project`, search for "
"the repository you want to create a project for, and then follow the "
"instructions from there."
msgstr ""
"安装 GitHub App 后，在 Read the Docs 点击 :guilabel:`Projects` 标签，点击 :guilabel:`Add"
" project` ，搜索要创建项目的仓库，然后按说明操作。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:344
msgid "Connect a repository to an existing project"
msgstr "将仓库连接到现有项目"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:346
msgid ""
"In case you manually added a project on Read the Docs, or if you want to "
"connect your project to a different repository, you need to install the Read"
" the Docs GitHub App and grant access to the repository you want to connect."
" As with adding a project, complete installation and permissions via the "
"links below, and select the repository from your **project settings on Read "
"the Docs**."
msgstr ""
"若你在 Read the Docs 手动添加了项目，或想将项目连接到其他仓库，需安装 Read the Docs GitHub App "
"并授权要连接的仓库。与添加项目类似，通过下方链接完成安装和授权，并从 **Read the Docs 项目设置** 中选择仓库。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:355
msgid ""
"Once you have installed the GitHub App, go to your project's "
":menuselection:`Settings` in Read the Docs, and select the repository you "
"want to connect from the :guilabel:`Connected repository` dropdown."
msgstr ""
"安装 GitHub App 后，前往 Read the Docs 中项目的 :menuselection:`Settings` ，从 "
":guilabel:`Connected repository` 下拉框选择要连接的仓库。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:359
msgid "Manually migrating a project"
msgstr "手动迁移项目"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:361
msgid ""
"We recommend using the migration page to migrate your projects from the old "
"OAuth application to the new GitHub App."
msgstr "我们建议用迁移页面将项目从旧 OAuth 应用迁移到新 GitHub App。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:363
msgid ""
"`Read the Docs Community <https://app.readthedocs.org/accounts/migrate-to-"
"github-app/>`__"
msgstr ""
"`Read the Docs Community <https://app.readthedocs.org/accounts/migrate-to-"
"github-app/>`__"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:364
msgid ""
"`Read the Docs Business <https://app.readthedocs.com/accounts/migrate-to-"
"github-app/>`__"
msgstr ""
"`Read the Docs Business <https://app.readthedocs.com/accounts/migrate-to-"
"github-app/>`__"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:366
msgid ""
"But in case you need to manually migrate a project, you can follow these "
"steps:"
msgstr "但如需手动迁移项目，可按以下步骤操作："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:369
msgid ""
"Go to your Read the Docs project's :menuselection:`Settings --> "
"Integrations`, and delete all the integrations that are listed there."
msgstr "前往 Read the Docs 项目的 :menuselection:`Settings --> Integrations` ，删除列出的所有集成。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:371
msgid ""
"Go to the settings page of your GitHub repository, click on the GitHub "
":guilabel:`Webhooks` tab, and delete all the webhooks with URLs that start "
"with:"
msgstr "前往 GitHub 仓库设置页面，点击 :guilabel:`Webhooks` 标签，删除所有以以下内容开头的 Webhook URL："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:374
msgid ""
"``https://readthedocs.org/api/v2/webhook/<your-project-slug>`` or "
"``https://app.readthedocs.org/api/v2/webhook/<your-project-slug>`` for Read "
"the Docs Community."
msgstr ""
"``https://readthedocs.org/api/v2/webhook/<your-project-slug>`` 或 "
"``https://app.readthedocs.org/api/v2/webhook/<your-project-slug>`` （Read the"
" Docs Community）。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:375
msgid ""
"``https://readthedocs.com/api/v2/webhook/<your-project-slug>`` or "
"``https://app.readthedocs.com/api/v2/webhook/<your-project-slug>`` for Read "
"the Docs Business."
msgstr ""
"``https://readthedocs.com/api/v2/webhook/<your-project-slug>`` 或 "
"``https://app.readthedocs.com/api/v2/webhook/<your-project-slug>`` （Read the"
" Docs Business）。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:377
msgid ""
"For projects using Read the Docs Business, go to the settings page of your "
"GitHub repository, click on the GitHub :guilabel:`Deploy keys` tab, and "
"delete the deploy key with a title matching the format "
"``support@readthedocs.com (<your-project-slug>)``."
msgstr ""
"对于 Read the Docs Business 项目，前往 GitHub 仓库设置页面，点击 :guilabel:`Deploy keys` "
"标签，删除标题匹配格式 ``support@readthedocs.com (<your-project-slug>)`` 的部署密钥。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:380
msgid ""
":ref:`Connect the project to the repository <reference/git-"
"integration:Connect a repository to an existing project>`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`将项目连接到仓库 <reference/git-integration:Connect a repository to an "
"existing project>` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:383
msgid "Revoking access"
msgstr "撤销访问权限"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:387
msgid ""
"If you revoke access to the GitHub App with any of the methods below, all "
"projects linked to that repository will stop working, but the projects and "
"their documentation will still be available. If you grant access to the "
"repository again, you will need to :ref:`manually connect your project to "
"the repository <reference/git-integration:Connect a repository to an "
"existing project>`."
msgstr ""
"若用下述任一方法撤销 GitHub App 访问权，关联该仓库的所有项目将停止工作，但项目及其文档仍可用。若再次授予仓库访问权，需 "
":ref:`手动将项目连接到仓库 <reference/git-integration:Connect a repository to an "
"existing project>` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:393
msgid ""
"You can revoke access to the Read the Docs GitHub App at any time from your "
"GitHub settings. All revocation options happen from your **account or "
"organization settings**; no action is required inside Read the Docs until "
"you decide to reconnect a project."
msgstr ""
"你可随时在 GitHub 设置中撤销 Read the Docs GitHub App 访问权。所有撤销操作在你的**账户或组织设置** "
"中进行；除非你决定重新连接项目，否则 Read the Docs 内无需操作。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:399
msgid "There are three ways to revoke access to the Read the Docs GitHub App:"
msgstr "撤销 Read the Docs GitHub App 访问权有三种方式："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:401
msgid "Revoke access to one or more repositories:"
msgstr "撤销一个或多个仓库的访问权："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:402
msgid ""
"Remove the repositories from the list of repositories that the GitHub App "
"has access to."
msgstr "从 GitHub App 有权访问的仓库列表中移除这些仓库。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:403
msgid "Suspend the GitHub App:"
msgstr "暂停 GitHub App："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:404
msgid ""
"This will suspend the GitHub App and revoke access to all repositories. The "
"installation and configuration will still be available, and you can re-"
"enable the GitHub App at any time."
msgstr "这将暂停 GitHub App 并撤销对所有仓库的访问权。安装和配置仍保留，你可随时重新启用 GitHub App。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:407
msgid "Uninstall the GitHub App:"
msgstr "卸载 GitHub App："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:408
msgid ""
"This will uninstall the GitHub App and revoke access to all repositories. "
"The installation and configuration will be removed, and you will need to re-"
"install the GitHub App and reconfigure it to use it again."
msgstr "这将卸载 GitHub App 并撤销对所有仓库的访问权。安装和配置将被移除，你需重新安装 GitHub App 并重新配置才能再次使用。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:413
msgid "Security"
msgstr "安全"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:415
msgid ""
"When cloning private repositories (|com_brand| only) Read the Docs creates "
"an `installation access token "
"<https://docs.github.com/en/rest/apps/apps?apiVersion=2022-11-28#create-an-"
"installation-access-token-for-an-app>`__, which has read access to the "
"`contents permission <https://docs.github.com/en/rest/authentication"
"/permissions-required-for-github-apps?apiVersion=2022-11-28#repository-"
"permissions-for-contents>`__, and it's scoped to the repository to be "
"cloned."
msgstr ""
"克隆私有仓库时（仅 |com_brand|），Read the Docs 会创建一个 `installation access token "
"<https://docs.github.com/en/rest/apps/apps?apiVersion=2022-11-28#create-an-"
"installation-access-token-for-an-app>`__ ，具有 `contents permission "
"<https://docs.github.com/en/rest/authentication/permissions-required-for-"
"github-apps?apiVersion=2022-11-28#repository-permissions-for-contents>`__ "
"读取权限，且仅针对待克隆仓库。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:420
msgid ""
"This token is valid for one hour and GitHub automatically grants read access"
" to the `metadata permission <https://docs.github.com/en/rest/authentication"
"/permissions-required-for-github-apps?apiVersion=2022-11-28#repository-"
"permissions-for-metadata>`__, which allows querying the repository "
"collaborators, events, and other metadata. By default, Read the Docs doesn't"
" show this token during the build, but the token is available during the "
"whole build process. Make sure to not print it in your build logs, and that "
"only trusted users are able to trigger builds on your project."
msgstr ""
"该令牌有效期 1 小时，GitHub 自动授予 `metadata permission "
"<https://docs.github.com/en/rest/authentication/permissions-required-for-"
"github-apps?apiVersion=2022-11-28#repository-permissions-for-metadata>`__ "
"读取权，允许查询仓库协作者、事件等元数据。默认构建时不显示该令牌，但整个构建过程中均可用。请勿在构建日志中打印它，并确保只有受信用户能触发项目构建。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:429
msgid ""
"If your repository is public, Read the Docs will not create an installation "
"access token."
msgstr "如果仓库是公开的，Read the Docs 不会创建 installation access token。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:433
msgid ""
"The build log page is publicly accessible only if your project and version "
"to build are marked as public. See more in :doc:`/commercial/privacy-level`."
msgstr "仅当项目和待构建版本标记为公开时，构建日志页面才公开可访问。详见 :doc:`/commercial/privacy-level` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:437
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "故障排查"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:439
msgid "Repository not found in the repository list"
msgstr "仓库列表中找不到仓库"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:440
msgid ""
"Make sure you have installed the corresponding GitHub App in your GitHub "
"account or organization, and have granted access to the repository your "
"project will be connected to."
msgstr "确保已在 GitHub 账户或组织安装相应 GitHub App，并授权项目将连接的仓库。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:446
msgid ""
"If you still can't see the repository in the list, you may need to wait a "
"couple of minutes and refresh the page, or click on the \"Refresh your "
"repositories\" button on the project creation page."
msgstr "如果仍在列表中看不到仓库，可能需等待几分钟并刷新页面，或在项目创建页面点击\"刷新仓库\"按钮。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:450
msgid "Installation on an organization is pending"
msgstr "组织安装待定"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:451
msgid ""
"If you aren't an owner of the GitHub organization, GitHub sends an "
"installation request to the organization owners instead of installing the "
"app. Read the Docs can't access the organization's repositories until an "
"owner approves the request. See GitHub's docs on `requesting a GitHub App "
"for your organization <https://docs.github.com/en/apps/using-github-"
"apps/requesting-a-github-app-from-your-organization-owner>`__."
msgstr ""
"如果你不是 GitHub 组织的所有者，GitHub 会向组织所有者发送安装请求而非直接安装 App。Read the Docs "
"无法访问组织仓库，直到所有者批准请求。请参阅 GitHub 文档中的 `请求组织的 GitHub App "
"<https://docs.github.com/en/apps/using-github-apps/requesting-a-github-app-"
"from-your-organization-owner>`__ 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:456
msgid "Repository is in the list, but isn't usable"
msgstr "仓库在列表中但不可用"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:457
msgid ""
"Make sure you have admin access to the repository you are trying to use for "
"your project. If you are using |org_brand|, make sure your project is "
"public, or use |com_brand| to create projects from private repositories."
msgstr "确保你对试图用于项目的仓库有管理员权限。如果使用 |org_brand|，请确保项目是公开的，或使用 |com_brand| 从私有仓库创建项目。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/git-integration.rst:461
msgid ""
"If you still can't use the repository for your project, you may need to wait"
" a couple of minutes and refresh the page, or click on the \"Refresh your "
"repositories\" button on the project creation page."
msgstr "如果仍无法将仓库用于项目，可能需要等待几分钟并刷新页面，或在项目创建页面点击\"刷新仓库\"按钮。"

